1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,210
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,510
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,340
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:05,910 --> 00:00:07,950
Since you got me fired
from the police force,

5
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:10,550
the least you can do is give me
the money you promised!

6
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:12,020
(Episode 94)

7
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:16,760
My money...

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:20,430
Hey. Get up, you punk.

9
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:22,490
That's enough!

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,470
Park Tae Ho!

11
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:41,180
That's got to hurt.

12
00:00:42,750 --> 00:00:45,550
But we're not done yet.

13
00:00:46,220 --> 00:00:47,850
What? What now?

14
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:55,890
Mr. Park Tae Ho, you are under
emergency arrest for soliciting...

15
00:00:56,030 --> 00:00:57,300
the murder of Baek Jun Gi
seven years ago...

16
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,360
and the attempted murder
of Baek Jin Ju.

17
00:01:00,230 --> 00:01:04,370
What's going on?
Let go of me. Let go!

18
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:09,340
They already closed that case,
concluding that Choi Sam Sik did it.

19
00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:11,180
What is the meaning of this?

20
00:01:11,410 --> 00:01:14,080
We submitted additional evidence.

21
00:01:14,680 --> 00:01:17,980
What? Evidence?
What kind of evidence?

22
00:01:18,350 --> 00:01:20,950
You can find out all about it
at the police station.

23
00:01:23,660 --> 00:01:26,160
And while you're at it, arrest...

24
00:01:26,720 --> 00:01:29,260
Deputy Chief Yun Hyeong Su
of the National Police Agency.

25
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:32,200
Me? Why me?

26
00:01:38,800 --> 00:01:42,610
When you hire someone,
you have to pay for their services.

27
00:01:43,010 --> 00:01:46,480
I got into this mess helping you
stop that police investigation.

28
00:01:46,880 --> 00:01:48,910
Since you got me fired
from the police force,

29
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:51,550
the least you can do is give me
the money you promised!

30
00:01:53,420 --> 00:01:56,420
As for the investigation
he helped block,

31
00:01:56,550 --> 00:01:57,990
you can look into that too.

32
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:01,330
And all this cash scattered here...

33
00:02:01,330 --> 00:02:03,330
will serve as additional evidence.

34
00:02:22,950 --> 00:02:25,080
What?
Father was taken by the police?

35
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:27,350
Yes. Apparently,
he was arrested while fighting...

36
00:02:27,420 --> 00:02:29,350
with Deputy Chief Yun
over a bag of money.

37
00:02:29,450 --> 00:02:31,060
I just don't understand
what happened.

38
00:02:31,890 --> 00:02:33,890
It seems he fell into a trap
set by Kim Dan Hui.

39
00:02:34,030 --> 00:02:36,260
Deputy Chief Yun is
with the police, right?

40
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,960
That means
there's no one on the force...

41
00:02:39,030 --> 00:02:40,300
to cover for Father anymore.

42
00:02:42,030 --> 00:02:44,300
I have the audio file of the call.

43
00:02:44,500 --> 00:02:46,540
When I'm ready,
I'll hand it to the police,

44
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:49,040
and Park Tae Ho will be arrested.

45
00:02:49,270 --> 00:02:51,880
So stop trying to protect him...

46
00:02:52,880 --> 00:02:54,080
and ruining yourself.

47
00:02:55,810 --> 00:02:57,820
Is this what she meant
by being ready?

48
00:02:58,350 --> 00:03:00,180
Wait. Ready for what?

49
00:03:00,250 --> 00:03:02,690
This isn't just
about simple bribery.

50
00:03:04,220 --> 00:03:06,790
That case seven years ago,
the whole Choi Sam Sik situation...

51
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:08,460
It could all come out.

52
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,730
I'm Park Tae Ho of the Adele Group.

53
00:03:16,430 --> 00:03:17,770
Open this cell right now.

54
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:20,440
Hey.
Do you all want to lose your jobs?

55
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:23,310
How dare you treat
a deputy chief this way?

56
00:03:23,370 --> 00:03:25,310
Seriously. Cut it out.

57
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:27,380
You're both just subjects
of an investigation.

58
00:03:31,180 --> 00:03:32,580
That punk.

59
00:03:33,050 --> 00:03:34,250
Park Tae Ho!

60
00:03:34,950 --> 00:03:36,650
This is all your fault.

61
00:03:36,720 --> 00:03:39,120
What? Look who's talking.

62
00:03:40,160 --> 00:03:42,690
Because you got greedy
and tried to steal my money,

63
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:46,330
we played right
into Kim Dan Hui's hands.

64
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,470
On top of that,

65
00:03:47,630 --> 00:03:49,100
you dare hit me?

66
00:03:49,700 --> 00:03:53,610
Once I get out of here,
I won't let you get away with this.

67
00:03:53,710 --> 00:03:54,710
Mark my words!

68
00:03:55,570 --> 00:03:57,410
I'd like to see you try.

69
00:03:58,410 --> 00:04:02,450
I know every crime you've committed.
And you still dare to threaten me?

70
00:04:02,610 --> 00:04:07,150
Either way, you're an accomplice.
Why you little...

71
00:04:09,550 --> 00:04:11,160
- What's going on?
- Hold on.

72
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:15,990
Why was
the Temi Bio investigation reopened?

73
00:04:16,190 --> 00:04:17,200
Well...

74
00:04:17,860 --> 00:04:19,260
An audio file
of Choi Sam Sik's phone call...

75
00:04:19,260 --> 00:04:20,700
was submitted as evidence.

76
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:22,570
What the heck?

77
00:04:23,500 --> 00:04:24,540
Hold on.

78
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,500
The recording was real,
not fabricated?

79
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:29,040
If this goes south, you could
be investigated while behind bars.

80
00:04:29,140 --> 00:04:30,140
What?

81
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:34,680
They won't find out what we did,
will they?

82
00:04:35,010 --> 00:04:36,980
There's no evidence of it.

83
00:04:37,820 --> 00:04:40,950
All we have to do is keep quiet,
so get a grip.

84
00:04:44,490 --> 00:04:47,190
Still, we need to be thorough.

85
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:49,460
If you don't want to get caught,

86
00:04:49,530 --> 00:04:50,960
bring my son to me right now.

87
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:52,700
Right now.

88
00:04:59,200 --> 00:05:02,270
(The Nation's Respected
and Beloved Police)

89
00:05:04,640 --> 00:05:06,340
You both did a great job.

90
00:05:06,410 --> 00:05:08,050
You're the one who did all the work.

91
00:05:08,780 --> 00:05:11,520
Anyway, thanks
to the phone recording,

92
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:14,120
the case from seven years ago
was reopened.

93
00:05:15,250 --> 00:05:17,890
Park Tae Ho and Deputy Chief Yun
have turned on each other.

94
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,760
And with the latter also arrested,

95
00:05:19,820 --> 00:05:22,190
there's nothing to stand in the way
of the investigation.

96
00:05:22,260 --> 00:05:23,260
Right.

97
00:05:23,460 --> 00:05:26,530
We can't let Park Tae Ho
get away with it this time.

98
00:05:27,870 --> 00:05:29,000
I'll stay here...

99
00:05:29,070 --> 00:05:31,840
and keep an eye
on the police investigation.

100
00:05:31,900 --> 00:05:34,110
Are you sure?
You're still recovering.

101
00:05:34,640 --> 00:05:36,240
I'm feeling much better,

102
00:05:36,310 --> 00:05:37,480
I can handle it.

103
00:05:37,710 --> 00:05:39,310
Just don't push yourself too hard.

104
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,880
Got it.

105
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:43,410
I'll prepare
for the shareholders' meeting...

106
00:05:43,850 --> 00:05:47,090
and secure Choi Yu Na's shares
while Park Tae Ho is locked up.

107
00:05:52,190 --> 00:05:54,660
(Stock Gift Agreement)

108
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,370
(Former Adele Group Chairman
Park Tae Ho Faces Detention)

109
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,900
(Deceased CEO Choi Sam Sik's Call
Surfaces as Evidence)

110
00:06:07,670 --> 00:06:09,310
Chairman Park was arrested?

111
00:06:11,280 --> 00:06:12,340
I knew it.

112
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:15,180
The audio recording of Dad's call
was real.

113
00:06:20,550 --> 00:06:21,890
You handed it over, didn't you?

114
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:24,160
What are you suddenly barking about?

115
00:06:24,220 --> 00:06:25,820
Dad's phone recording.

116
00:06:25,890 --> 00:06:27,330
How could Baek Jin Ju
possibly have it?

117
00:06:27,430 --> 00:06:28,630
You're the one who gave it to her.

118
00:06:31,400 --> 00:06:35,630
How could you lie to me?
Do you even know what you've done?

119
00:06:36,630 --> 00:06:37,900
Of course I do.

120
00:06:38,270 --> 00:06:39,500
Park Tae Ho, that scum.

121
00:06:40,270 --> 00:06:42,940
He's going to pay
for killing your father.

122
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:44,180
Then what about me?

123
00:06:44,310 --> 00:06:46,180
If Dad's phone recording
is released,

124
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,810
it makes me a liar.

125
00:06:47,880 --> 00:06:50,180
I framed my father as a murderer.

126
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:51,720
Well, it's the truth.

127
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:54,520
If you've done wrong,
you need to beg for forgiveness.

128
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:57,790
You need to reveal that Park Tae Ho
killed Jin Ju's father...

129
00:06:57,860 --> 00:06:59,790
and your father too.

130
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:01,330
If it comes out that Chairman Park
is a murderer,

131
00:07:01,390 --> 00:07:02,860
do you think I'll be safe?

132
00:07:04,900 --> 00:07:07,430
Think about when Chairman Park
came to you with this.

133
00:07:07,500 --> 00:07:09,470
Whether to take his anger out on me
or to shut me up,

134
00:07:10,070 --> 00:07:11,900
he might kill me.

135
00:07:13,270 --> 00:07:15,240
What's a man behind bars
going to do?

136
00:07:15,910 --> 00:07:16,970
Don't you worry.

137
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:19,540
You think Chairman Park
will just quietly go to prison?

138
00:07:19,810 --> 00:07:21,480
He'll find a way out.

139
00:07:21,480 --> 00:07:24,920
I need these shares
if I want any hope of staying safe.

140
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,520
Sign it.

141
00:07:28,720 --> 00:07:31,320
I need these shares
if I want to live.

142
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:46,900
Baek Jin Ju.
What are you doing here?

143
00:07:52,240 --> 00:07:53,410
Hey, Jin Ju.

144
00:07:55,010 --> 00:07:56,210
(Stock Gift Agreement)

145
00:07:58,980 --> 00:08:01,650
You didn't even show up
to your dad's funeral,

146
00:08:02,020 --> 00:08:03,550
but you're here claiming his stocks?

147
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:05,160
What is this?

148
00:08:05,760 --> 00:08:09,690
Are you really shamelessly
coming after my dad's stocks?

149
00:08:18,870 --> 00:08:20,500
Okay, delivery's here.

150
00:08:20,810 --> 00:08:22,710
(Bongmyeong Neighborhood Coffee)

151
00:08:22,840 --> 00:08:24,040
What's all this?

152
00:08:24,080 --> 00:08:25,080
This?

153
00:08:25,340 --> 00:08:27,180
I placed the order.

154
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,550
- If you had told me, I...
- I know.

155
00:08:30,550 --> 00:08:32,120
You would've made me pay for them.

156
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:34,890
I'm telling you, James is
way more thoughtful than you are.

157
00:08:35,290 --> 00:08:36,390
It's no big deal.

158
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:38,820
It's a special occasion,
so my treat.

159
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:41,390
You can get drinks, meals,
and even dessert delivered...

160
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:43,660
all at once from one place.

161
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:46,630
Ordering is so convenient too,

162
00:08:46,700 --> 00:08:49,500
and you can get something
for everyone's taste.

163
00:08:49,570 --> 00:08:50,870
It's totally my style.

164
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:54,640
Well, since you're treating us
to celebrate,

165
00:08:54,710 --> 00:08:57,280
it'll taste even better.
Let's all dig in.

166
00:08:57,740 --> 00:08:59,580
Sounds good. Then I'll have...

167
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:08,420
Putting Park Tae Ho
in a holding cell...

168
00:09:08,490 --> 00:09:10,190
makes this taste so much better.

169
00:09:11,090 --> 00:09:14,360
This coffee tastes
especially amazing today.

170
00:09:14,430 --> 00:09:16,090
As I was brewing this coffee,

171
00:09:16,190 --> 00:09:17,660
I just couldn't stop humming.

172
00:09:18,730 --> 00:09:21,870
We can put Park Tae Ho in prison
for good this time, right?

173
00:09:22,200 --> 00:09:25,100
He may have been arrested,
but we can't let our guard down.

174
00:09:25,300 --> 00:09:27,740
We need to start preparing
for our next move.

175
00:09:28,740 --> 00:09:32,640
Park Tae Ho still has one last card
up his sleeve.

176
00:09:33,640 --> 00:09:36,550
I have to make use
of the slush fund ledger.

177
00:09:37,650 --> 00:09:40,450
Is there even anything
in your slush fund ledger?

178
00:09:41,190 --> 00:09:45,090
Even you kept a ledger
of your bribes.

179
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:48,760
Do you think I, Park Tae Ho,
would be any less prepared?

180
00:09:49,560 --> 00:09:50,930
From politicians...

181
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,630
to judges, prosecutors,
and police officers,

182
00:09:55,100 --> 00:09:57,470
I have records of everyone
who took my money.

183
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:59,870
Are you planning to blackmail them?

184
00:09:59,970 --> 00:10:02,540
That's right. If I'm detained,

185
00:10:02,610 --> 00:10:04,610
the slush fund ledger gets released.

186
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:07,410
Make it clear that if I fall,
everyone falls with me.

187
00:10:08,950 --> 00:10:10,110
Detained?

188
00:10:11,450 --> 00:10:13,350
Is the situation that serious?

189
00:10:13,950 --> 00:10:16,990
The other side
turned over a recording...

190
00:10:18,860 --> 00:10:20,620
of Choi Sam Sik's call as evidence.

191
00:10:21,660 --> 00:10:23,730
Now it looks like
I'm responsible for everything...

192
00:10:23,790 --> 00:10:25,500
that happened seven years ago.

193
00:10:26,560 --> 00:10:27,570
So,

194
00:10:28,470 --> 00:10:30,870
where's the slush fund ledger?

195
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,270
In a P.O. box.

196
00:10:33,100 --> 00:10:34,670
No one else has access to it.

197
00:10:35,910 --> 00:10:38,140
They'll only open it
if I'm there in person.

198
00:10:38,410 --> 00:10:39,740
In person?

199
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,850
Then how are we supposed to open it?

200
00:10:43,150 --> 00:10:45,450
Just do exactly as I say.

201
00:10:47,650 --> 00:10:50,420
I, Park Tae Ho,
will step up and fix this.

202
00:10:58,160 --> 00:11:00,900
Just remember what I told you.

203
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:02,130
I got it, okay?

204
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:03,330
Don't worry.

205
00:11:25,920 --> 00:11:27,460
Mr. Park, what's wrong?

206
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:28,790
My chest...

207
00:11:30,030 --> 00:11:32,630
Help, I can't breathe.

208
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:38,200
Look at you putting on a show.

209
00:11:39,270 --> 00:11:40,700
I'm not faking it.

210
00:11:40,810 --> 00:11:44,110
You injured me when you beat me up.

211
00:11:47,040 --> 00:11:51,180
If I die here,
it'll be because of you.

212
00:11:51,280 --> 00:11:52,280
Because of you!

213
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:56,190
You're using me as an excuse
to get out of here?

214
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:58,920
Don't fall for it.

215
00:11:58,990 --> 00:12:00,520
Once he's taken out of here,

216
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,860
he'll obviously just run away
to avoid being detained.

217
00:12:04,900 --> 00:12:06,000
That's why,

218
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:09,300
if I end up in custody,

219
00:12:09,800 --> 00:12:12,840
the first thing I'm doing
is telling them...

220
00:12:13,070 --> 00:12:14,510
how Choi Sam Sik died.

221
00:12:15,370 --> 00:12:17,680
I should even explain in detail...

222
00:12:18,580 --> 00:12:20,710
why there's no evidence
of the crime.

223
00:12:24,580 --> 00:12:25,750
I bet you both...

224
00:12:26,580 --> 00:12:28,720
enjoyed taking my money.

225
00:12:29,620 --> 00:12:30,890
But that money...

226
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:34,660
was also advanced payment
for situations like this.

227
00:12:36,430 --> 00:12:39,060
Unless you want to go down with me
as accomplices,

228
00:12:40,230 --> 00:12:41,900
do as I say.

229
00:12:50,880 --> 00:12:52,410
Unbelievable.

230
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:55,580
I get it, all right?

231
00:13:03,150 --> 00:13:04,990
We already have men posted
outside his door.

232
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:06,660
Are the cuffs necessary?

233
00:13:06,860 --> 00:13:08,130
He's right.

234
00:13:08,460 --> 00:13:12,630
I haven't even been detained yet,
so don't treat me like a criminal.

235
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:15,170
Do you want my lawyer
to file a complaint...

236
00:13:15,730 --> 00:13:17,430
and get you cited
for a human rights violation?

237
00:13:19,940 --> 00:13:21,170
Keep a close watch on him,

238
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:23,610
- and come back after the checkup.
- Yes, sir.

239
00:13:35,550 --> 00:13:37,390
Park Tae Ho is at the hospital?

240
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:41,060
Yes, I went back to the station
early this morning,

241
00:13:41,230 --> 00:13:44,560
and they said he was transferred
to the hospital for medical reasons.

242
00:13:44,660 --> 00:13:46,130
I'm sure he's faking it.

243
00:13:46,830 --> 00:13:49,000
He's going to open
the P.O. box himself.

244
00:13:49,070 --> 00:13:51,840
Right. I also saw Oh Jung Ran
and Hyun Jun.

245
00:13:51,840 --> 00:13:53,200
It seems they'll go with him.

246
00:13:53,470 --> 00:13:56,510
Park Tae Ho will definitely head
for the P.O. box,

247
00:13:56,740 --> 00:13:58,380
so I'll head over there.

248
00:13:58,440 --> 00:14:00,980
Then I'll go to the hospital
and keep watch.

249
00:14:01,480 --> 00:14:02,510
Yoon Jung and I...

250
00:14:02,510 --> 00:14:05,080
will keep an eye on Oh Jung Ran
and Park Hyun Jun.

251
00:14:05,280 --> 00:14:06,280
Wait.

252
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,450
Shouldn't we tell Jin Ju?

253
00:14:08,450 --> 00:14:11,690
Actually, she's been over
at Choi Yu Na's house since yesterday.

254
00:14:11,790 --> 00:14:14,790
She needs to secure the shares
that Choi Sam Sik left behind.

255
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:16,090
Right.

256
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:18,560
It's better for Jin Ju
to focus on that.

257
00:14:18,860 --> 00:14:21,170
Let's handle this one on our own.

258
00:14:31,910 --> 00:14:33,040
Can I help you?

259
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:35,910
I'm Park Min Jun,
Chairman Park Tae Ho's son.

260
00:14:36,650 --> 00:14:37,880
I heard he was taken
to the hospital,

261
00:14:37,950 --> 00:14:38,950
so I came to check on him.

262
00:14:39,820 --> 00:14:42,020
Even family isn't allowed to visit.
Please leave.

263
00:14:48,960 --> 00:14:51,030
Are you the only officer
posted outside?

264
00:14:51,700 --> 00:14:54,130
- Excuse me?
- Why don't I see anyone else?

265
00:14:54,930 --> 00:14:56,830
Do I have to explain
every little detail to you?

266
00:14:56,900 --> 00:14:59,640
Are you sure
Chairman Park Tae Ho is inside?

267
00:14:59,970 --> 00:15:03,670
Look, I'm just going to confirm
that he's inside.

268
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:06,040
What do you think you're doing?

269
00:15:16,890 --> 00:15:19,060
Mr. Park went to get tested.

270
00:15:19,460 --> 00:15:20,520
Is that so?

271
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:23,090
Whether you lost track of him
or let him go,

272
00:15:23,730 --> 00:15:25,430
you can explain it
to your bosses yourself.

273
00:15:31,240 --> 00:15:33,800
Park Tae Ho slipped out
of the hospital.

274
00:15:37,440 --> 00:15:38,440
Park Tae Ho.

275
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:44,350
Getting the slush fund ledger...

276
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:46,180
to save yourself, are you?

277
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:49,490
I already anticipated your plan.

278
00:15:53,560 --> 00:15:57,430
You followed me all the way here
just to get in my way?

279
00:15:58,660 --> 00:16:00,300
If it means I can take you down,

280
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:03,200
I'd follow you
to the ends of the earth.

281
00:16:03,700 --> 00:16:04,770
Park Tae Ho,

282
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,270
you faked a medical emergency
just to try and escape?

283
00:16:07,670 --> 00:16:09,810
We'll tie this to the Temi Bio case
from seven years ago...

284
00:16:09,870 --> 00:16:11,710
and request that you be detained.

285
00:16:14,550 --> 00:16:15,910
The slush fund ledger...

286
00:16:16,110 --> 00:16:18,220
must've been the last card
you had to play.

287
00:16:19,580 --> 00:16:21,320
Once that ledger is submitted
as evidence,

288
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:23,490
you won't be dodging custody.

289
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,890
You're right.
I might be detained right away.

290
00:16:29,290 --> 00:16:32,360
That is, if the slush fund ledger
you mentioned was actually here.

291
00:16:33,430 --> 00:16:34,430
What?

292
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:37,030
No way.

293
00:16:42,440 --> 00:16:43,510
Park Tae Ho.

294
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:47,950
Just do exactly as I say.

295
00:16:48,250 --> 00:16:50,910
I, Park Tae Ho,
will step up and fix this.

296
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,580
What are you going to do?

297
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:58,390
First off,
we need to lose Kim Dan Hui.

298
00:16:58,760 --> 00:17:01,460
She knows
where the slush fund ledger is.

299
00:17:01,830 --> 00:17:04,260
When she hears I've gotten out,

300
00:17:04,900 --> 00:17:06,430
she'll come
after the slush fund ledger...

301
00:17:06,860 --> 00:17:08,930
and show up with the police.

302
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:12,370
Isn't that too risky?

303
00:17:13,870 --> 00:17:16,510
Don't worry.
The slush fund ledger...

304
00:17:16,740 --> 00:17:18,310
was already moved
to a different locker.

305
00:17:19,110 --> 00:17:21,910
I'll go to the facility,
verify my identity,

306
00:17:22,480 --> 00:17:24,380
and tell you where it really is.

307
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:27,380
While I'm distracting Kim Dan Hui,

308
00:17:27,990 --> 00:17:29,650
go to that said locker,

309
00:17:30,490 --> 00:17:32,190
and secure the ledger.

310
00:18:01,620 --> 00:18:02,990
The slush fund ledger.

311
00:18:03,720 --> 00:18:05,260
Where did you hide it?

312
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:07,460
A slush fund ledger?

313
00:18:07,890 --> 00:18:09,790
Why would I have
something like that?

314
00:18:10,060 --> 00:18:11,060
What?

315
00:18:11,360 --> 00:18:14,670
But let's say, for argument's sake,
that it did exist.

316
00:18:15,070 --> 00:18:16,300
Kim Dan Hui,

317
00:18:17,000 --> 00:18:18,270
you've been had.

318
00:18:19,700 --> 00:18:20,900
This time, you're the one...

319
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:24,580
who played right into my hands.

320
00:18:25,810 --> 00:18:27,380
How's that for a comeback?

321
00:18:29,150 --> 00:18:30,350
Park Tae Ho.

322
00:18:32,280 --> 00:18:33,720
And...

323
00:18:34,520 --> 00:18:36,750
an arrest warrant?

324
00:18:37,390 --> 00:18:38,890
Go ahead and file one.

325
00:18:39,620 --> 00:18:43,290
Because I, Park Tae Ho,
will never let myself get detained.

326
00:18:44,430 --> 00:18:47,900
I suppose
I should tell you that as well.

327
00:18:49,870 --> 00:18:50,900
Let's go.

328
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:14,490
Hyun Jun.

329
00:19:16,230 --> 00:19:17,230
How did it go?

330
00:19:17,490 --> 00:19:19,330
Did you get the slush fund ledger?

331
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,560
Yes.

332
00:19:21,900 --> 00:19:24,840
- Here.
- All right. Let's get going.

333
00:19:24,900 --> 00:19:26,140
Hold on.

334
00:19:26,870 --> 00:19:28,210
Don't rush into this.

335
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:31,280
Just think about it one last time.

336
00:19:31,640 --> 00:19:32,780
Think about what?

337
00:19:34,140 --> 00:19:35,350
Chairman Park Tae Ho...

338
00:19:35,980 --> 00:19:38,850
Can't we let him go to prison?

339
00:19:38,850 --> 00:19:39,920
What?

340
00:19:39,980 --> 00:19:43,050
Everyone would be better off
if he were in prison.

341
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:45,290
If he goes to prison now,

342
00:19:45,490 --> 00:19:47,290
he won't be getting out
anytime soon.

343
00:19:47,390 --> 00:19:50,490
Then Hyun Jun's secret
won't hit as hard...

344
00:19:50,930 --> 00:19:52,800
when it comes out.

345
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:56,730
What about the Adele Group
and the chairman position?

346
00:19:57,630 --> 00:19:58,900
If Park Tae Ho's arrest sticks,

347
00:19:58,970 --> 00:20:01,200
Hyun Jun's candidacy for chairman
will be in jeopardy.

348
00:20:01,870 --> 00:20:04,440
I'm doing all this
so we don't lose Adele Group...

349
00:20:04,510 --> 00:20:06,180
to Baek Jin Ju and Kim Dan Hui.

350
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,540
That's my point!

351
00:20:08,410 --> 00:20:11,850
If he gives up Adele Group
and sends Park Tae Ho to prison,

352
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:15,390
he could get a chance...

353
00:20:16,450 --> 00:20:19,520
at a normal life like everyone else.

354
00:20:19,520 --> 00:20:23,190
Normal as in ordinary?
Don't be ridiculous!

355
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:48,050
You lost the slush fund ledger?

356
00:20:49,920 --> 00:20:52,760
Park Tae Ho read our next move...

357
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:53,920
and beat us to it.

358
00:20:54,390 --> 00:20:57,490
We had eyes on Oh Jung Ran
at the company...

359
00:20:57,730 --> 00:21:00,560
but somehow, we lost Park Hyun Jun.

360
00:21:01,260 --> 00:21:03,270
If he was going to get help,
I assumed...

361
00:21:04,030 --> 00:21:06,470
Oh Jung Ran would make
the first move.

362
00:21:06,540 --> 00:21:07,870
Park Hyun Jun...

363
00:21:08,040 --> 00:21:10,240
I guess he's completely
on Park Tae Ho's side now.

364
00:21:10,570 --> 00:21:13,140
Right.
Since it's Park Tae Ho's last play,

365
00:21:13,410 --> 00:21:15,080
they would've coordinated
the whole thing.

366
00:21:15,080 --> 00:21:17,580
What happens if Park Tae Ho uses
that slush fund ledger...

367
00:21:17,650 --> 00:21:20,220
to blackmail the recipients?

368
00:21:20,850 --> 00:21:22,420
We worked so hard
to get him locked up...

369
00:21:22,490 --> 00:21:24,420
and get an arrest warrant issued.

370
00:21:24,790 --> 00:21:26,620
What if he's released?

371
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:31,560
It's not over yet.
We need to be more careful.

372
00:21:32,560 --> 00:21:34,930
We need to figure out
how Park Hyun Jun and Oh Jung Ran...

373
00:21:34,930 --> 00:21:36,570
plan to use the slush fund ledger
and stop them.

374
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,800
Plus, to prepare
for the shareholders' meeting,

375
00:21:38,870 --> 00:21:41,100
we need to lock down
our allies' shares.

376
00:21:44,170 --> 00:21:46,640
Wait.
How are things on Jin Ju's end?

377
00:21:47,240 --> 00:21:49,780
Are there still no updates
on CEO Choi's shares?

378
00:21:50,250 --> 00:21:52,550
Because of Choi Yu Na,
it's not proving to be easy.

379
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:55,420
I offered to lift the seizure
for Ms. Hong...

380
00:21:55,750 --> 00:21:58,920
and buy them at a fair price,
so now we just wait.

381
00:22:03,260 --> 00:22:05,860
At the very least,
Jin Ju's plan has to succeed.

382
00:22:08,900 --> 00:22:10,200
(Stock Gift Agreement,
Stock Transfer Agreement)

383
00:22:12,170 --> 00:22:13,640
What are you doing
in someone else's home?

384
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:16,240
How long are you going
to keep this up?

385
00:22:17,570 --> 00:22:19,710
How dare you stand here
after killing my father?

386
00:22:20,710 --> 00:22:22,750
And now you want his shares too?

387
00:22:24,080 --> 00:22:25,620
Where's your conscience?

388
00:22:25,680 --> 00:22:27,180
Stop being ridiculous.

389
00:22:27,550 --> 00:22:29,550
Park Tae Ho is the one
who killed your father.

390
00:22:29,990 --> 00:22:31,390
You're the shameless one,

391
00:22:31,390 --> 00:22:33,820
trying to give the shares to him.

392
00:22:35,060 --> 00:22:37,830
It's your decision, Mom.
Is it me or Baek Jin Ju?

393
00:22:44,570 --> 00:22:45,570
So...

394
00:22:46,670 --> 00:22:49,170
This one is to gift the shares,

395
00:22:49,810 --> 00:22:51,710
and this one is to transfer them.

396
00:22:52,010 --> 00:22:54,680
Gosh.
I can't give them to this person,

397
00:22:54,880 --> 00:22:56,350
and I can't give them
to that person either.

398
00:22:56,550 --> 00:22:57,950
I'm going to lose my mind.

399
00:23:00,080 --> 00:23:02,050
Why are you two doing this to me?

400
00:23:02,120 --> 00:23:05,290
What's there to think about?
My life is on the line!

401
00:23:05,360 --> 00:23:07,490
Ms. Hong, you can't back down now.

402
00:23:07,560 --> 00:23:09,390
If Park Tae Ho regains power,

403
00:23:09,560 --> 00:23:10,990
more innocent people will die,

404
00:23:11,060 --> 00:23:13,400
just like my father
and your husband.

405
00:23:13,530 --> 00:23:16,000
Baek Jin Ju, shut your mouth.

406
00:23:16,100 --> 00:23:18,500
Choi Yu Na, please, snap out of it.

407
00:23:19,570 --> 00:23:20,600
That's enough.

408
00:23:21,370 --> 00:23:24,340
My head's killing me. My gosh.

409
00:23:29,480 --> 00:23:32,750
Jin Ju, promise me one thing.

410
00:23:36,550 --> 00:23:37,550
My Yu Na...

411
00:23:39,660 --> 00:23:41,320
Can you keep her safe?

412
00:23:42,560 --> 00:23:43,560
Mom?

413
00:23:43,660 --> 00:23:45,860
If Park Tae Ho tries to kill Yu Na,

414
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:48,530
can you save her?

415
00:23:49,170 --> 00:23:51,870
I'll stop Park Tae Ho
so he can't kill...

416
00:23:52,500 --> 00:23:54,810
anyone else, not just Yu Na.

417
00:23:55,770 --> 00:23:57,710
That's why
I need these shares so badly.

418
00:23:58,610 --> 00:23:59,610
Okay.

419
00:24:00,110 --> 00:24:01,510
That's all I need to hear.

420
00:24:03,950 --> 00:24:05,850
(Stock Transfer Agreement)

421
00:24:06,050 --> 00:24:07,120
Mom!

422
00:24:11,790 --> 00:24:13,360
How could you do this to me?

423
00:24:13,790 --> 00:24:16,390
How can you choose her
over your own daughter?

424
00:24:16,530 --> 00:24:18,630
Are you saying you don't care
if I die?

425
00:24:18,860 --> 00:24:20,300
Oh, honestly.

426
00:24:21,030 --> 00:24:24,130
You need to pull yourself
together now. All right?

427
00:24:25,040 --> 00:24:28,570
I did this to stop you
from getting blood on your hands.

428
00:24:29,070 --> 00:24:31,510
Yu Na. Please, I'm begging you.

429
00:24:31,780 --> 00:24:34,510
Cut ties with Park Tae Ho's family.

430
00:24:34,540 --> 00:24:37,350
No. It's you I'm cutting ties with.

431
00:24:37,410 --> 00:24:40,080
I don't have a mom or a dad anymore!

432
00:24:40,680 --> 00:24:44,820
Oh, dear. Choi Yu Na!

433
00:24:46,990 --> 00:24:50,230
Oh, that girl.
What am I going to do with her?

434
00:24:53,200 --> 00:24:55,130
I'll keep a tighter watch on her.

435
00:24:56,500 --> 00:24:57,500
All right.

436
00:24:58,400 --> 00:24:59,670
Jin Ju, please.

437
00:25:00,200 --> 00:25:03,910
Please keep her safe
and look out for her, okay?

438
00:25:06,440 --> 00:25:09,110
Oh, goodness.

439
00:25:11,080 --> 00:25:12,250
Gosh, my head.

440
00:25:21,260 --> 00:25:23,390
Well, now. How have you been?

441
00:25:26,830 --> 00:25:29,570
You left like you were off
to do something important.

442
00:25:31,500 --> 00:25:33,070
If you don't know anything,

443
00:25:33,970 --> 00:25:35,710
just shut up and watch.

444
00:25:35,970 --> 00:25:37,770
The arrest warrant
will be dismissed,

445
00:25:38,070 --> 00:25:41,340
and I'll walk out of here
with my head held high.

446
00:25:41,680 --> 00:25:43,210
I wouldn't be so sure about that.

447
00:25:43,610 --> 00:25:45,680
I think I'll be the one
getting out first.

448
00:25:47,380 --> 00:25:49,850
They didn't even apply
for an arrest warrant,

449
00:25:50,250 --> 00:25:52,620
which means I'm walking out of here
in 48 hours.

450
00:25:56,030 --> 00:25:57,490
Because of you,

451
00:25:58,230 --> 00:26:00,760
I'm going
to lose my badge regardless.

452
00:26:00,860 --> 00:26:04,730
So I'm getting paid
one way or another.

453
00:26:06,100 --> 00:26:09,110
I'll get it from your family
if I have to,

454
00:26:10,010 --> 00:26:11,110
so tell them to cooperate.

455
00:26:14,810 --> 00:26:18,520
If you want to get paid,
keep your mouth shut and stay quiet.

456
00:26:19,680 --> 00:26:21,150
The second I'm out of here,

457
00:26:21,550 --> 00:26:23,890
if you get in the way of my job,

458
00:26:25,090 --> 00:26:26,660
I'll shut that mouth of yours
for good...

459
00:26:27,490 --> 00:26:30,690
just like I did with Choi Sam Sik.

460
00:26:32,060 --> 00:26:34,160
You think a threat like that
is going to work on me?

461
00:26:34,900 --> 00:26:37,530
Do you take me for a fool
like Choi Sam Sik?

462
00:26:40,270 --> 00:26:41,970
Deputy Chief, you're free to go.

463
00:26:45,740 --> 00:26:47,340
I knew it.

464
00:26:47,980 --> 00:26:48,980
Wait.

465
00:26:51,610 --> 00:26:55,390
Hey, you'd be wise
not to ignore my warning.

466
00:26:56,450 --> 00:26:57,450
Whatever.

467
00:26:58,020 --> 00:27:01,020
You'd better worry
about saving your own skin.

468
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:07,800
Hey!

469
00:27:25,050 --> 00:27:26,050
About helping the chairman...

470
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:29,550
Where are we with that?

471
00:27:34,220 --> 00:27:35,560
If he's detained,

472
00:27:35,630 --> 00:27:37,630
the shareholders
will support Baek Jin Ju.

473
00:27:38,230 --> 00:27:40,030
Last time he was arrested,
they threw a fit...

474
00:27:40,030 --> 00:27:42,130
and refused to acknowledge you
as his successor.

475
00:27:43,000 --> 00:27:44,530
My father's shares are gone now,

476
00:27:45,100 --> 00:27:46,640
so it's game over.

477
00:27:47,070 --> 00:27:49,740
What? Someone took his shares?

478
00:27:50,770 --> 00:27:51,780
That's right.

479
00:27:51,780 --> 00:27:54,910
Baek Jin Ju sweet-talked my mom
into handing them over.

480
00:27:55,750 --> 00:27:57,780
We must keep the chairman
from getting arrested at all costs,

481
00:27:58,850 --> 00:28:00,380
and win over the shareholders.

482
00:28:04,450 --> 00:28:05,490
Don't tell me...

483
00:28:06,290 --> 00:28:08,730
you're still hesitating
because of Baek Jin Ju.

484
00:28:11,560 --> 00:28:15,170
If you let her take over
as chairman,

485
00:28:15,630 --> 00:28:17,100
I won't just stand by
and do nothing.

486
00:28:17,370 --> 00:28:19,870
I'll tell everyone
whose son you really are,

487
00:28:20,870 --> 00:28:21,910
so get your act together.

488
00:28:22,570 --> 00:28:24,370
Who do you think you're threatening?

489
00:28:26,040 --> 00:28:29,350
Shouldn't I be the one asking you
how you lost the shares?

490
00:28:31,050 --> 00:28:33,750
Stay out of my business,
and get your own act together.

491
00:28:55,470 --> 00:28:57,440
Hello, Assemblyman Kwon.

492
00:28:58,940 --> 00:29:00,840
I'm Park Hyun Jun,
son of Adele Group's...

493
00:29:01,080 --> 00:29:02,150
Chairman Park Tae Ho.

494
00:29:03,610 --> 00:29:06,150
I'd like to meet with you
on my father's behalf.

495
00:29:07,880 --> 00:29:09,420
All that money
you've been taking from us...

496
00:29:10,950 --> 00:29:12,420
It's time to settle the bill.

497
00:29:32,240 --> 00:29:33,880
What are you doing?

498
00:29:33,980 --> 00:29:35,080
Get out of my way.

499
00:29:35,410 --> 00:29:38,550
Are you really going to take
Hyun Jun to see Assemblyman Kwon?

500
00:29:39,780 --> 00:29:41,550
If he finds out
about the slush fund ledger,

501
00:29:41,650 --> 00:29:43,950
there's no telling how he'll react.

502
00:29:45,120 --> 00:29:48,090
He might even hurt Hyun Jun
for blackmailing him.

503
00:29:48,890 --> 00:29:52,000
That slush fund ledger could blow up
in your face at any moment.

504
00:29:52,260 --> 00:29:54,400
It's a ticking time bomb.

505
00:29:54,630 --> 00:29:57,670
Why are you so scared
when we have all the leverage?

506
00:29:58,330 --> 00:30:01,340
The slush fund ledger
will give Hyun Jun all the power.

507
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:03,240
But...

508
00:30:05,140 --> 00:30:06,340
What did you just say?

509
00:30:06,810 --> 00:30:08,140
What slush fund ledger?

510
00:30:09,710 --> 00:30:11,450
Did you find
the chairman's slush fund ledger?

511
00:30:11,680 --> 00:30:14,220
This has nothing to do with you,
so stay out of it.

512
00:30:14,380 --> 00:30:16,820
How can I stay out of it?
The chairmanship is at stake.

513
00:30:18,020 --> 00:30:21,520
And things are already bad
since Baek Jin Ju took our shares.

514
00:30:22,330 --> 00:30:24,930
What?
You let Baek Jin Ju take the shares?

515
00:30:26,100 --> 00:30:28,230
How could you handle
things so poorly?

516
00:30:28,730 --> 00:30:30,100
Do you think
I let her take them on purpose?

517
00:30:30,300 --> 00:30:33,400
I want Hyun Jun to be chairman
just as much as you do.

518
00:30:33,500 --> 00:30:35,910
You know what?
Ms. Choi, just stay out of this.

519
00:30:36,370 --> 00:30:38,210
You're no help
to Hyun Jun whatsoever.

520
00:30:38,470 --> 00:30:39,940
What do you mean I'm no help?

521
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:47,280
Hey there.

522
00:30:52,860 --> 00:30:55,730
So, let me ask you something.

523
00:30:58,160 --> 00:31:01,100
Who are you to just show up
and start asking questions?

524
00:31:02,800 --> 00:31:06,270
"I'll tell everyone
whose son you really are."

525
00:31:08,000 --> 00:31:09,070
What did you mean by that?

526
00:31:12,840 --> 00:31:13,840
Could it be...

527
00:31:16,480 --> 00:31:19,480
that Park Hyun Jun
isn't Park Tae Ho's son?

528
00:31:24,050 --> 00:31:25,050
Really?

529
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:28,160
Seriously? No way.

530
00:31:29,130 --> 00:31:31,330
Did I just stumble onto a secret?

531
00:32:06,960 --> 00:32:09,700
(Pearl in Red)

532
00:32:09,870 --> 00:32:11,430
Choi Yu Na, you...

533
00:32:11,500 --> 00:32:12,700
Why are you taking it out on me?

534
00:32:12,700 --> 00:32:14,940
Because you're the one
who messed everything up.

535
00:32:15,170 --> 00:32:16,970
This is your mess, so clean it up.

536
00:32:17,070 --> 00:32:19,880
Get the money somehow
and shut Deputy Chief Yun up.

537
00:32:20,410 --> 00:32:22,080
If you don't bring
the slush fund ledger...

538
00:32:22,080 --> 00:32:24,310
before the shareholders' meeting,

539
00:32:24,310 --> 00:32:26,320
I'll reveal Hyun Jun's secret.

540
00:32:26,580 --> 00:32:27,650
So think carefully.

541
00:32:27,950 --> 00:32:31,420
That goes for you two,
Kim Dan Hui, and Baek Jin Ju.

542
00:32:31,950 --> 00:32:34,360
No one is taking Adele Group...

543
00:32:34,690 --> 00:32:36,230
away from me.

544
00:32:36,930 --> 00:32:38,930
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
